# TENS-S3 Project Libraries

This directory is intended for project-specific (private) libraries and Hardware Abstraction Layers (HAL). PlatformIO will compile them to static libraries and link them into the executable file.

## Component Overview

The TENS-S3 firmware is modularized into the following components:

| Library | Description | Key Responsibilities |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`oled`** | Display Manager | Handles the SSD1306/SH1106 OLED display using `u8g2`. Manages UI states (Time Config, Program Select, Running, Error). |
| **`hbridge_driver`** | Output Power Stage | controls the H-Bridge and Flyback converter using ESP32 **MCPWM**. Handles dead-time insertion, frequency generation, and emergency stops. |
| **`intensity_control`** | Logic & Safety | Implements the main State Machine. Handles button inputs (Debounce), manages session timers, and calculates target intensity levels. |
| **`current_monitor`** | Feedback Loop | Reads the current sensor via ADC. Provides real-time feedback for the PID loop and detects "Lead Off" (electrode disconnection) events. |
| **`buzzer`** | User Feedback | Controls the passive piezoelectric buzzer using **LEDC**. Provides acoustic feedback for button presses, alarms, and session completion. |

## Directory Structure

The source code of each library is placed in a separate directory to maintain clean separation of concerns:

```text
|--lib
|  |
|  |--oled
|  |  |- oled.c          // UI rendering tasks and u8g2 callbacks
|  |  |- oled.h          // UI State definitions
|  |
|  |--hbridge_driver
|  |  |- hbridge_driver.c // MCPWM configuration and Flyback logic
|  |  |- hbridge_driver.h
|  |
|  |--intensity_control
|  |  |- intensity_control.c // Button ISRs and State Machine logic
|  |  |- intensity_control.h
|  |
|  |--current_monitor
|  |  |- current_monitor.c // ADC reading and averaging
|  |  |- current_monitor.h
|  |
|  |--buzzer
|  |  |- buzzer.c        // Non-blocking tones and alarms
|  |  |- buzzer.h
|  |
|  |- README.md --> THIS FILE
|
|- platformio.ini
|--src
   |- main.c